      "comment": "Ajaw: Kinich and the Contract",
      "content": "Kinich found the ancient being sealed deep in a ruin unearthed by an earthquake; after days of testing, they signed a pact. Ajaw heeds Kinich's commands and lends limited strength; in return Kinich shows him the world and gives his body to Ajaw when he dies. Ajaw resents it but stays. A Dendro Vision appeared when Kinich nearly died, so Ajaw did not get the body. Kinich sends him to \"timeout\" when he is rude.",
