      "comment": "Ajaw: The Thirteen Sovereign Lords",
      "content": "The Thirteen Sovereign Lords were artificial intelligences made by Xiuhcoatl using Secret Source technology; each ruled a region of Natlantea. Ajaw is most likely the Tenth. The Sovereign Rulers' Council Records say the Tenth Lord was fooled by a jade imitation of another Lord's token and sealed alive in the mountains.",
