      "comment": "Ajaw: Ineffa and Citlali's Investigation",
      "content": "When Ajaw met Ineffa, he went unusually quiet; Citlali says he was reacting to the Sovereign Lord core in her chest. Kinich put him in timeout for three days, then Ifa sent Cacucu to pester him until he blurted \"sovereign ruler\", which Citlali used to start identifying the Lords. Citlali thinks he cannot recall which he was, though he refuses to say.",
