      "comment": "Ajaw: Enjou and the Abyss",
      "content": "Ajaw despises the Abyss. He insulted Enjou when Kinich confronted him, then spent days with him for \"behavior lessons\" and struck a mock deal with him over Kinich's body. This was a ruse so the Traveler could interrogate Enjou.",
