      "content": "During the 5.6 Whirling Waltz event (limited), Kinich took Ajaw to Fontaine to investigate smuggling. Fontainian law on certain days banned flying objects, so Ajaw hid. He liked Navia's manners, and Kinich let him thrash the culprit Angoulvant with glee.",
